**trajectory_tui.dart** — add after resolveTrajectorySession / near it:

```dart
/// The verb's read contract (gh-1555 W1 rework, review): `view`/`cost`/
/// `inspect` read the whole branch, so the whole ledger is primed
/// through the bounded chunked scan first; `tail` follows the resident
/// window plus the live-tail ingest and NEVER primes — priming would
/// re-raise the gh-1073 `tooLarge` refusal for over-the-backstop
/// sessions (gratuitous: the tailer never reads the head) and
/// materialize an unbounded ledger into the window just to print the
/// backfill. The tail backfill is therefore the resident window, not
/// the whole ledger — the honest trade for a verb whose contract is
/// "follow the tail" (memory-bounded at any ledger size).
Future<List<SessionRecord>> trajectoryVerbRecords(
  Session session,
  String verb,
) async {
  if (verb != 'tail') {
    await session.ensureWholeLedgerResident();
  }
  return session.getBranch();
}
```

